# spec: SETGET [1.10] multipoint takes one byte, 0 for off; the headphones answer with the new state.
# source: NOTES.md SETGET table ([1.10] 1 byte: 0=off, 1=on); the reply 06 is the state PR #47's hardware report read back after SETGET 00
device qc_ultra2
call set_multipoint off
send 01 0a 02 01 00
recv 01 0a 03 01 06
result ok
